{"type":"last-prompt","lastPrompt":"Okay,  Let's close week 2 milestone.  Keep a11y at week 7. But we need to make sure all the new codes we are shipping are compliance to exiting standards (including but not limited to a11y).","leafUuid":"f8f0d3b8-d62f-40e9-8f68-8ea23b01c5c5","sessionId":"641b53ca-47b3-45aa-9ab6-6db8524d561d"}
